WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.939
- Darling, you can major
in anything you want,

00:00:02.939 --> 00:00:04.671
as long as you become a doctor.

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:08.954
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.954 --> 00:00:12.614
(speaking Tagalog)

00:00:12.614 --> 00:00:14.695
(speaking Korean)

00:00:14.695 --> 00:00:19.461
(speaking Tagalog)

00:00:19.461 --> 00:00:22.222
(speaking Korean)

00:00:22.222 --> 00:00:24.942
- All that money I spent
sending you to college courses

00:00:24.942 --> 00:00:26.265
when you were in the fourth grade,

00:00:26.265 --> 00:00:27.765
and you want to go to video school?

00:00:27.765 --> 00:00:30.671
(speaking Korean)

00:00:30.671 --> 00:00:32.486
- Your SAT scores are so low.

00:00:32.486 --> 00:00:34.827
(speaking Tagalog)

00:00:34.827 --> 00:00:39.347
(speaking Korean)

00:00:39.347 --> 00:00:40.941
(speaking Tagalog)

00:00:40.941 --> 00:00:42.803
- You don't want to be the first person

00:00:42.803 --> 00:00:45.222
from our entire Tamil Sri Lankan community

00:00:45.222 --> 00:00:47.357
to go to a community college.

00:00:47.357 --> 00:00:49.490
(speaking Korean)

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:53.021
(speaking Tagalog)

00:00:53.021 --> 00:00:54.749
(speaking Korean)

00:00:54.749 --> 00:00:57.043
(speaking Tagalog)

00:00:57.043 --> 00:00:58.835
- No applying to New York schools.

00:00:58.835 --> 00:01:00.925
In New York, everyone does the drugs.

00:01:00.925 --> 00:01:03.016
(speaking Tagalog)

00:01:03.016 --> 00:01:05.053
- You know, you might
fall into the bad crowd.

00:01:05.053 --> 00:01:07.080
(speaking Tagalog)

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:11.505
(speaking Korean)

00:01:12.915 --> 00:01:16.177
(upbeat music)

00:01:16.177 --> 00:01:18.310
(speaking Tagalog)

00:01:18.310 --> 00:01:20.205
- Boys and girls living together?

00:01:20.205 --> 00:01:21.196
Shame!

00:01:21.196 --> 00:01:23.947
(speaking Korean)

